  "articleBody": "An in-law suite can be created as an attached addition, converted garage, interior bedroom suite, or permitted ADU, depending on privacy goals, available space, utilities, zoning, and budget. Before hiring, define whether occupants need a private kitchen and entrance, then ask a design-build contractor to verify feasibility, permits, structure, plumbing, electrical capacity, and construction scope for the property.",
